      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc8d",
          "text": "Dog bite victims are often reluctant to pursue a claim because they don’t want to sue a neighbor or homeowner. In almost all cases, that concern is unfounded: claims are filed against the owner’s insurance company, and most are resolved through an out-of-court settlement rather than a lawsuit. If you already have a settlement offer, we can review it to confirm it accounts for your injuries and accident-related costs, both now and in the future.",
