        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc8k",
          "text": "Get Medical Care:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc8l",
          "text": " Have any bite looked at, even if it seems minor, since punctures can lead to infection or, in rare cases, rabies, according to the",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sc8n",
